31,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Now that the first night has passed, does anyone have something to report?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,"I have noticed nothing unusual yet, as we have not spoken much.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Um... I have something to say. I'm the Seer, and I checked Takumi. He is the werewolf!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"What?! That's a lie! Yumi, why are you lying about me?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"A very early reveal. This is quite a bold strategy, Yumi.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, claiming the Seer role immediately is risky. Are you certain?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"If she is telling the truth, the problem is solved right here.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm sure! I saw it clearly. Please believe me!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm a villager! She's the werewolf trying to trick you all!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,It is a classic conflict. One of them is likely lying.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, your reaction is a bit too aggressive. It makes you look suspicious.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,I tend to trust the Seer's direct evidence over emotional pleas.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I just want to help everyone! Please, we have to vote for Takumi!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not aggressive, I'm just angry that she's lying!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I find Yumi's conviction quite touching, though it could be an act.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'm inclined to trust Yumi. The logic of a fake Seer is less appealing here.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,I agree. Let us follow the Seer's lead.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Thank you! Please, let's vote for Takumi!","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,This is unfair! You're all making a huge mistake!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will go with the majority. It seems the village has decided.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
